<title>USA: New Mexico sets Feb 11 for $64.8 mln GO bond sale.</title>
<headline>New Mexico sets Feb 11 for $64.8 mln GO bond sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Mexico plans to sell $64.8 million general obligation bonds by competitive bids on Feb 11, the state's financial adviser Public Financial Management said on Friday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
